    "turn_idx": 3,
    "turn_text": "and to assert the proper relationship between the people and the government in American democracy, all of us who aspire and attain to public office for whatever period of time are nothing but the servants of the people. And we're not the masters of the people in the moment. We think we're the masters of the people. It's time to evict, eject, reject, impeach, convict, remove, start again, and any of us in public office is easily dispensable, and it's the people and the society itself that matter.",
