    "turn_idx": 19,
    "turn_text": "The good news is that the vast majority of the American people are opposed to all of these things. Already a majority of the American people agree with the impeachment and the removal of President Trump for selling our election and our democracy out by organizing this shakedown of President Zelensky. And generally a majority is resisting all of these reactionary efforts, which is why it is the undemocratic mechanisms of power that the Republicans are manipulating, like the Supreme Court and the Electoral College and gerrymandering of districts. It's all about figuring out these tactics and employees to prevent the majority from governing. But the majority needs to be mobilized and educated and activated in a very serious way and the democratic forces in America need to be coordinating with democratic forces around the world in a much more powerful way, because all of the right-wing and authoritarian forces are in constant daily touch. I mean, look at Trump, and Putin, and Orban, and Duterte, and LCC, and all of these people are working together. The royal crown prince of Saudi Arabia, who assassinated and dismembered a Washington Post journalist, is in constant touch with the Trump administration about his plans and his policy. The Democratic forces have got to get organized in the same way.",
