    "turn_text": "Mm. Sticking with the impeachment process and you being a member of the Judiciary Committee when that went through the House, how would you rate the challenging job of Democrats showing forbearance in the need to proceed with impeachment for the sake of constitutional protection of democracy without zealotry for bringing down a president they see as dangerous on many levels?",
