    "turn_text": "No pun intended. Maybe intended a little bit, but you know, you can't take money from a corporation, the AMI, the National Enquirer people, you can't take money and then spend it on a campaign purpose, which is hush money for mistresses in order to silence them. And it very clearly had an electoral purpose. And that was the whole point of it. But I think that if anybody has a sense of institutional forbearance and partisan self-restraint, it is Speaker Pelosi who has an interest in the whole. And I represent one strong Democratic Progressive District. Maryland, which you know well.",
