        "confidence": 0.93
      },
      {
        "text": "When the phrase 'checks and balances' appears in the Federalist Papers, it refers specifically to the relationship between the House and the Senate.",
        "confidence": 0.92
      },
      {
        "text": "The framers of the Constitution were primarily concerned about preventing presidential tyranny.",
