  {
    "episode_id": 92347,
    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/9/2/92347.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 83,
    "turn_text": "An argument might be made that this president's inclinations toward extreme responses as we're experiencing in Iran are part of his nature and may have nothing to do with a presumption of wagging the dog or trying to divert attention. Nonetheless, let's acknowledge the very serious situation that we are experiencing right now related to the situation in Iran and the destabilization in the Middle East.",
