    "turn_idx": 106,
    "turn_text": "As he continues to do these things that are putting our country at threat, our democracy at threat, and our clear violations of law, does that at all put pressure on senators in the midst of this impeachment trial to, you know, will there be the five or six Republican members who put pressure on McConnell to let this be something that is a fair trial for a dangerous president that's making decisions that are putting us in harm's way.",
