        "text": "If a president drags foreign powers into U.S. elections using American resources, American democracy will never be the same.",
        "confidence": 0.96
      },
      {
        "text": "I hope that Senators Susan Collins, McCalsky, Mitt Romney, and Kennedy will begin to feel the weight of responsibility.",
        "confidence": 0.95
      },
      {
        "text": "We felt the weight of responsibility in the House.",
        "confidence": 0.92
      },
      {
        "text": "There is nothing preventing a future president from leveraging foreign aid to influence other democracies in U.S. elections.",
