        "text": "The current political leaders have a moral obligation to uphold democratic integrity.",
        "confidence": 0.94
      },
      {
        "text": "Foreign interference in U.S. elections undermines the legitimacy of American democracy.",
        "confidence": 0.93
      },
      {
        "text": "Future presidents will act opportunistically if unchecked by institutional constraints.",
        "confidence": 0.9
      },
      {
        "text": "American democratic institutions are vulnerable to abuse by executive overreach.",
        "confidence": 0.89
      },
      {
        "text": "The speaker and others in the House acted responsibly during a prior crisis involving election interference.",
