        "confidence": 0.89
      },
      {
        "text": "Leadership in Congress has a responsibility to model empathetic and unifying communication.",
        "confidence": 0.88
      },
      {
        "text": "Darkness refers to morally corrosive impulses that undermine democratic norms.",
        "confidence": 0.87
      },
      {
        "text": "The public is receptive to appeals for unity based on emotional authenticity over ideological rigidity.",
