  {
    "episode_id": 92347,
    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/9/2/92347.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 119,
    "turn_text": "Yeah. I agree with that and sign me up. I'm all for that. I'm sure I'm as guilty of it as anybody else that I use the partisan labels as kind of signifiers for a progressive direction and a retrograde direction. And I should, and after all, as the Republicans like to point out and correctly point out, the Democratic Party was the party of the Dixie Crats and racism for a long time in our country.",
